without having the humiliation of a proper application. So he talks to the IMF and they say, look, we've cobbled together some of the money, most of it from the US Federal Reserve. We can lend you the money, but there are conditions. The chairman of the Federal Reserve, Guy good Arthur Burns, describes himself as a Neanderthal Conservative,
