the alternative economic strategy with capital letters. And this was the cherished dream of the Labour left for about 15 years or so. And what this was was like capitalism is obviously terrible. Let's have a siege economy. We'll put up protectionist Trumpian tariffs. We'll have state controls. Stop British money going out. Stop foreign goods coming in.
“替代经济战略”（Alternative Economic Strategy），大写字母。这是工党左翼大约15年左右的珍视梦想。这就是像资本主义显然很糟糕。让我们建立一个“围城经济”。我们将建立保护主义的特朗普式关税。我们将进行国家控制。停止英国资金外流。停止外国商品进入。

