capitalism. We should fight for our own people. The British establishment is now infected with the same spirit which afflicted France in 1940, the Vichy spirit of complete capitulation and defeatism. Of course, it's only what, what is it, 35 years since Vichy? But also since Haley had been storming the beaches at Antio. So Haley is absolutely outraged by this. Healy had fought. Tony Ben had been in the RF but didn't see any action.
