The heat wave is over. It's absolutely pouring with rain. Because they had appointed a minister for drought, hadn't they? And then it immediately started bucketing down. Yeah. They appointed a minister for drought, and he did a rain dance, and then immediately it started. And shared his bath with his wife, didn't he? Yes, he encouraged people to save water.
